WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.370
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.370
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.690
Here at Starlight Academy,

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:16.670
the idol training school, we've finally entered our second year.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:22.250
Moreover, a bunch of new girls aiming to become the a idol have joined us here.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:25.730
Now we've got cute underclassmen of our own!

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.500
We were each assigned to be a trainer for a first-year, and I looked after...

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.760
At least one of the new students has caught the media's attention already.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.910
Kitaouji Sakura-chan.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:41.900
Ever since she was young, Sakura-chan learned traditional dance, and has mastered several other ancient art forms.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.860
Ichigo-sama, allow me to continue humbly asking for your guidance

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:48.400
in any matters still to come.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.400
Letsh be good friends from now on.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.660
I'm gonna make sure that I don't lose to the new students!

00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:00.600
And among all the bustle, even more amazing news came.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:05.160
Ichigo, Ichigo, Ichigo!

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:06.740
Hurry and check this out!

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.780
Aoi, what's up?

00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:13.320
They're holding the Fresh Girls Cup this year too.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.770
What's that?

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:16.680
Good thing you're sitting already. {as in, 'you'd better sit down first', but like this} {I get it}

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:20.430
It's the only chance that every student can directly challenge Mizuki-chan.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:21.970
What?!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.950
The Fresh Girls Cup.

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:05.590
It's your chance to compete with the Academy's top idol, the Starlight Queen.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:07.840
It's an annual tradition.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.230
As challengers, you will face

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:13.790
the two-year defending champion, the Starlight Queen—

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.840
the one and only Kanzaki Mizuki.

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:22.590
Every student here has the right to challenge her.  She will face all of you by herself. {alone?} {it's fine}

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.560
It'll be a great battle. Yeah.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.280
Wow, so it's true that we can face Mizuki-chan directly.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:33.730
It's about time for her speech.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:38.170
I look forward to seeing the results of the blood, sweat, and tears you've put into your daily Aikatsu

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.410
up close and personal. {??} {I don't think I resolved your confusion but I did change the line}

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:44.740
There are things that can only be felt when standing on the same stage, after all.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:48.240
All of your fans are looking forward to it as well.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:52.750
Girls, now is the time to passionately and enjoyably test the results of your Aikatsu against me.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.860
We can't take it easy here. {I saw this line in Aegisub and I knew immediately what the Japanese was going to be}

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.990
I know, right? We get to directly face Mizuki-chan.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:08.420
That's true, but even more amazing is that Mizuki-chan's going to face every single student alone.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.390
Yeah!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.390
Mizuki-san is far more than you're giving her credit for.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:18.900
I went up against her in last year's Fresh Girls Cup.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:22.140
Ichigo and I transferred in, so we missed it last year.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:22.900
Yeah.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:27.030
Back then, the word "amazing" couldn't even begin to describe her.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:31.750
In order to accept every single student's challenge,

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.410
she went up on stage countless times.

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:41.130
And on top of that, she used special appeals in every single song.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:46.710
The Special Appeals she used during that 
Fresh Girls Cup number over one hundred.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.920
What?! No way!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.140
I was watching it online, but I couldn't believe it either.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:56.690
Even before that, when she was only a first-year, Mizuki-san

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.150
came out of nowhere to beat the incumbent Starlight Queen.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.780
So nobody was expecting it?

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.150
It's one of the many Mizuki Legends.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.830
We're going to be facing an amazing top idol like her.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.410
It's time to get fired up.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.910
Right. The last time we performed together...

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:16.120
Mizuki-chan made up for when I couldn't finish my Special Appeals.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:22.130
This time for sure I won't let her upstage me! {I feel like maybe you need some commas, but also like maybe you don't need commas...}

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.540
On top of all of that, our rivals are the entire school. {their rivals, or Mizuki's?}

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.370
It's not going to be easy.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:32.280
Let's do it!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.270
I'm first!

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:45.780
It's Sakura-chan.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.270
Appeal!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.670
Rest for five minutes.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.560
Ichigo-sama!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.900
Amazing! So you're training to use Appeals already.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:11.680
That's no surprise.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:13.880
You were watching over me?

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.930
Yeah, you were great, Sakura-chan.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.440
But really, good job grabbing hold of a teacher.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.880
Their demand is up 200% right now.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.610
That much?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:25.990
My coach came and asked me personally to join her.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.490
You weren't the one who asked?

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:32.270
Yes. She asked me to pass my regards on to my brother, Sakon.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.500
It's great that you've got a teacher training you.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.890
Yes, it's all for the sake of performing with my idol, Mizuki-sama. {I don't think you can use inspiration like that, and there aren't any good alternatives....}

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:45.790
I have only been able to see this day in my dreams until now. {you wanna use 'till'?} {no}

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:50.010
I will do everything in my power to remain to the very end.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:51.750
Kitaouji-san.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.350
I will take my leave now.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.440
Let's find a good place to train too.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:59.300
Okay.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.230
What's this?

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.530
It's a video message from Johnny-sensei.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:11.280
Fresh Girls Cup new rule announcement?

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:14.530
Yeah!

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:19.040
Even for him, this is too long...

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:22.270
I bet you want me to hurry it up, right, Honey?

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:25.540
I totally understand. I know, yeah!

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:26.830
Come on...

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:28.050
Hurry!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.680
Fresh Girls Cup new rule announcement!

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:36.000
You will now have to perform three Appeals at the timing I give.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.270
But, I won't tell you what my timing is.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.770
If you're unable to do it immediately, you fail!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:43.920
What?!

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.480
Fail immediately...

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:47.820
There wasn't a rule like this last year.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.720
I'm the one who suggested this new rule.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.820
It's all to make a more passionate and enjoyable concert.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.840
Do your best, everyone.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.600
Okay!

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.790
Ran, Aoi, let's do this!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:03.830
Right. But now the bar is unmistakably higher.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.350
First we fill our stomachs! {Why does Aegisub spellcheck say stomaches is a word}

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.710
What should I have today?

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:13.350
Don't eat too much.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:17.600
We're here to talk about how to train, not about what to eat.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.100
Huh? Yurika-chan?

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.910
You having lunch too?

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.350
I'm fighting.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:35.510
Until the Fresh Girls Cup ends, I definitely won't eat <i>that</i>.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:39.390
I'm wagering six hundred years' worth of pride. {fade in my Aikatsu?}{it's more likely than you think}

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.920
By <i>that</i>... you mean garlic ramen?

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.410
You're not gonna eat it? But it's your favorite.

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.250
Quiet!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.130
Don't say things like that so loudly!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:54.030
Garlic is a natural weakness of vampires, after all.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.860
This garlic ramen smells delicious.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.640
She's being drawn in!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.320
Just how much does she like it?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:08.000
Yurika-chan, why don't you have some if you love it that much?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.540
One more word and I'll suck your blood!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:13.330
Though right now I'm sticking to green juice. {dunno if there's any other word for it} {wikipedia says green drink, but that's hardly any better}

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.880
You're not even drinking tomato juice?

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.870
Not eating garlic ramen, and drinking only green juice.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:23.750
It just goes to show that you've gotta be careful what you eat before the Fresh Girls Cup.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.720
It's not like I won't not agree to that.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:29.180
I'm off. There are too many distractions here.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.420
Everyone's doing their best.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.970
Right. So what should we do?

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:38.050
I don't think we'll be able to find a good training place on school grounds right now.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:42.880
I know a good place!

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.730
Angely Mountain!

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.190
So why Angely Mountain? {Aren't the teachers on 200% demand? How did they get Johnny?}

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.560
Training must be done in the mountains!

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.800
It's a perfect place to do some strength training.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:10:00.450
Plus, there's no way anyone else from school would be here, so we'll be able to concentrate more.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.200
We'll focus on improving our concentration.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.970
Being able to use Appeals on demand is going to require a lot of it.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:13.210
Johnny-sensei, thank you for driving us.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:18.010
I welcome any and all proactive requests! Fight, everyhoney.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:22.970
Alright, let's go.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:27.650
Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu!

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.480
Owwie!

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.010
Otome-chan?

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.240
You alright? Here.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.450
Thank you!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.320
I'm good now. Love you!

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.220
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:47.450
Why are you out here, anyway?

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.560
I was running on the path up there, and then I slipped and fell,

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:53.530
and then "roll roll" and "tumble tumble" and owwie!

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.630
And here I am.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:11:00.840
I'm a bit tired after running all the way here from Starlight Academy.

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.440
You ran all the way here?!

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:05.560
Otome-chan, you never do things halfway.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.670
Everything will go to waste if you get hurt. Why don't you rest a bit?

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:10.850
Don't worry, I can still keep going!

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:16.760
I was only able to use one Appeal last year.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:21.910
So this time I'm going to show Mizuki-chan how much I've grown this year!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.180
Let's do our best, Otome-chan.

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.180
Aye!

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.600
Okay, let's go!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:31.920
Wai— Ichigo...

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.810
Acts as soon as she thinks, huh.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:35.920
Love!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:41.180
<i>I'm not going to be left behind by Mizuki-chan this time.</i>

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.940
<i>More! I need to put more effort in!</i>

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.460
<i>To put on the best performance...</i>

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.690
<i>We'll train our bodies to the bone!</i>

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.440
Love you!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.940
D{*\c&H643CC1&}ef{*\c&H6942C5&}e{*\c&H5F36BD&}at {*\c&H4722A5&}M{*\c&H411D9D&}i{*\c&H3A1995&}zu{*\c&H381792&}k{*\c&H3D1A96&}i{*\c&H411C9A&}!

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:06.910
<i>Surpass my own limits...</i>

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:16.960
<i>I want her to see my very best!</i>

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:25.940
<i>I hope they aren't forgetting the most important thing...</i>

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.350
Let's end our dance practice here.

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:46.630
Sounds good. Too bad we still have a lot left though.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:53.180
The most important ability we need is the concentration to perform a Special Appeal on command.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:56.920
We need the will to stand firm no matter what.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.420
And that's on top of both dancing and singing perfectly.

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:03.420
We don't have much time left. Let's go.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.970
Right.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.540
<i>An energetic dance.</i>

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:22.690
<i>Concentration, a strong will, and long practices. {the parallelism is all not-parallel...}</i>

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.620
<i>I feel like we have everything we need...</i>

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.700
<i>But it's like there's still something we're missing.</i>

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.610
Hello, Onee-chan?

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:40.210
Raichi, what's wrong?

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:43.580
Well, I mean, there's nothing actually "wrong"...

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.030
Isn't it almost time for the Fresh Girls Cup?

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.220
Aren't you going to challenge Mizuki-chan?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:52.050
I didn't want to disturb you, but I couldn't help but call.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:53.970
What's Aoi-neesan doing right now? {hard to do it in order} {huh?}

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.350
Aoi's memorizing the song now.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.730
Ran's doing the same with the dance.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:04.780
Onee-chan, are you feeling okay?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.740
Huh, of course I am. Why?

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.780
Well, you aren't smiling at all...

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.920
I mean, normally you'd say,

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:18.530
"Geez, you sure do love Aoi, Raichi."

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:19.790
Wouldn't you?

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:22.430
Raichi...

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:23.940
Thank you!

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.300
Huh, why?

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:28.930
I'll make you a special seaweed bento next time I'm home as thanks!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.090
But why?

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.770
I'll call you later, Raichi.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:32.810
S-Sure...

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.820
Ran, Aoi.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.870
Let's have fun with Aikatsu!

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.810
Wh-What's with you all of the sudden?

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.960
There are so many things that we need to think about for the performance,

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:50.320
and we've trained so hard that we're all so tense. {I'm pretty sure turtles are rather chill creatures}

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:53.830
But think back about what Mizuki-chan first said.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.330
All of your fans are looking forward to it as well.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:01.830
Girls, now is the time to passionately and enjoyably test the results of your Aikatsu against me.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:06.120
We aren't just doing this for ourselves. We need to have fun for our fans.

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.340
Hey, what is it?

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:12.730
Tickle tickle tickle!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.100
Sto—

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.960
Tickle tickle tickle...

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:18.580
But yeah, you're right.

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.850
Fans won't have fun at a concert unless the idol's having fun too.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:22.950
Right?

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:24.550
You're spot on.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.640
Tickle tickle tickle tickle!

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:29.150
No, stop!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:33.120
Stop! {Stoop}

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.570
It's finally the day!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:43.460
I feel like a weight's been lifted off my shoulders thanks to you.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.410
No problem.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.360
Let's put everything we've been practicing to use and go all out.

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:53.330
Otome-chan.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.420
Were you trying to catch a rainbow again?

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:56.510
Aye.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.020
It was a rainbow that was thiiis big!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.140
You sure do go at your own pace.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:04.630
That's the best part about her.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:08.470
Thanks to you, all my nervousness has seemed to disappear.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.030
Love you!

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:17.910
Perform three Appeals when I give the signal.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.160
If you're unable to do it then you fail immediately.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:26.420
Now, Fresh Girls Cup... let's start!

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.450
It's begun.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.020
My heart's going "thump thump". {aye}

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:37.150
But I never would have expected the six of us to be put together for the challenge.

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:38.560
I'm super ready for this!

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:41.570
I can be more confident knowing that Ichigo-sama will be by my side.

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:44.940
If you hold Yurika-sama back I'll suck your blood out.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:51.400
Not a single girl's been able to make it until the end.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:54.400
There are two groups left. Next up is Starmiya's. {did he just inflect an English word?}

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.460
So that we leave no regrets...

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.290
Let's put everything into this!

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:13.800
Ready, set—

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.000
Go!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.120
It's finally Hoshimiya's turn.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:35.200
Everyhoney, fight!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.810
Let's appeal!

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:29.750
Let's appeal!

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:53.930
Let's appeal!

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:06.240
Arisugawa, Toujou, Kitaouji, fail!

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:29.850
Hoshimiya, Kiriya, Shibuki, you pass!

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:31.850
We did it! {RAN SO MOE}

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:35.230
Although Mizuki had the highest Excitement Level,

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:37.330
you three did wonderfully.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:43.150
One week from today you four will enter the semifinals.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:45.240
Even against Mizuki, dance like you want to win! {tsui, reference wo irechatta}

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.410
Yes!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:51.940
I never expected the final signal to appeal to appear from a different location...

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:53.940
I was a moment too late.

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:56.380
So was Otome...

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:01.270
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.550
Mizuki-san.

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.510
Congratulations on making it to the semifinals, Hoshimiya.

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:10.510
Next time I'll definitely stand as your equal!

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:15.230
I can't wait.

00:23:55.760 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:00.400
If you get too engrossed in training, {split because easiest solution}

00:24:00.400 --> 00:24:01.920
your smile just naturally disappears.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:04.500
Yeah, but being tickled by Ichigo made me realize.

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:07.420
If you forget to smile, you'll get tickled!

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:09.880
Have fun with Aikatsu!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:13.600
It's so amazing that we all made it to the semifinals.

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:15.350
Even though Mizuki-chan was amazing...

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:16.950
The three of us in our own way...

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:18.720
Will aim for victory and do our best!

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:20.160
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.160 --> 00:24:21.550
Mizuki and Soft-Shelled Turtle

00:24:21.550 --> 00:24:24.080
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
